# Hand-derived expected index frame F-S1 (plan 07-02, D-21, D-23): ivs-demo-lamp-tone-1, idle, both lamp rows unlit.
# Derivation: docs/video/demo-lamp-tone-1-derivation.md section (e), written before the program, the scenarios or any run; never produced by a run.
# Plane grammar: 96 rows after the line plane, each 20 groups of 8 symbols (0-9A-F) separated by one space; the 8th symbol of group 20
# is the cut-off pixel of the 7-pixel last column (clip side right) and is written -. The published plane is the 159 columns left of it.
# Lamp rows: row 4 (port 0, BACKTAB 0256..025D, plane x 48..111, y 32..39) shows 11111111 and row 7 (port 1, BACKTAB 0292..0299, y 56..63) shows 11111111,
# lamp i left to right at x 48 + 8 i, index 1 unlit (word 0801) and index 2 lit (word 0802); every other cell is the fill word 0000 (index 0).
